{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "考試前最後一天，星期一。", "text_idx": 158, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一早還是慣例的全校集會。", "text_idx": 144, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『──不過，下週開始暫時沒有全校集會了喔。理由很不識趣所以大家不要問。』", "text_idx": 138, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 159, "voice": "rk0050", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然是慣例，但暫時就到今天為止的樣子。", "text_idx": 163, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "台上的學園長伸手示意大家安靜，然後聳了聳肩。", "text_idx": 148, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她沉默地環視台下的學生們。", "text_idx": 149, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "平時總是煽動學生情緒的學園長，今天……好像有點不一樣？", "text_idx": 153, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "原本不滿的學生也逐漸察覺到了異常，大家的視線都集中在學園長身上。", "text_idx": 147, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『……那麼！明天起就是考試，大家都知道吧？』", "text_idx": 137, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 159, "voice": "rk0051", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "抓準這個絕妙的時機，學園長換了一個話題。", "text_idx": 155, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的演講力真不是蓋的，學生們都被她牽引著情緒。", "text_idx": 150, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『好女人必須具備知性。雖然即使笨一點男孩子也能接受……』", "text_idx": 141, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 159, "voice": "rk0052", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『但是既然現在身為結女的一員，就必須遵從我們的理念。』", "text_idx": 140, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 159, "voice": "rk0053", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "也就是說，請各位考試加油。", "text_idx": 146, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這句話不必說出口也傳達到了每個人心中。所有學生們都一起繃緊了神經。", "text_idx": 161, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不能讓學園長看到自己糟糕的模樣……的感覺。", "text_idx": 145, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──啊啊，這就是考試前的結女的氣氛啊。", "text_idx": 129, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『……結女的各位平常就聽我說過了，現在再提一次。』", "text_idx": 136, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 159, "voice": "rk0054", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學園長在講台上優雅地微笑。", "text_idx": 151, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『人類這種生物，隨時都在尋找「另一半」。』", "text_idx": 139, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 159, "voice": "rk0055", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『所以，為了相遇的那一刻，成為一個好女人吧！』", "text_idx": 142, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 159, "voice": "rk0056", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 130, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 156, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "讓人印象深刻的一句話呢。", "text_idx": 160, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那什麼感佩的表情啊。你想成為好女人嗎？」", "text_idx": 135, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 154, "voice": "ar0546", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔哇好噁。」", "text_idx": 131, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 157, "voice": "sn0098", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾同學有女裝癖啊。」", "text_idx": 134, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 152, "voice": "ag0278", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果我是M的話新吾是女裝癖啊～」", "text_idx": 133, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 162, "voice": "ht0156", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喂。」", "text_idx": 132, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 156, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
